      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a radiant dimension where souls reboot as data. Recover your reincarnation machine from alien terrorists and explore glowing temples of memory, logic, and light. A surreal odyssey through death, rebirth, and the beauty of being lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Afterlife reimagines what comes after everything ends. You awaken beyond the veil — not as a ghost or god, but as a packet of cosmic information trying to recompile itself. What begins as a simple mission to recover your stolen device becomes a metaphysical journey through reality’s code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every space hums with strange energy: temples that sing, landscapes made of wireframe dreams, and alien prophets that speak in corrupted files. It’s beautiful, unsettling, and strangely comforting — like a fever dream that remembers you fondly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game invites reflection, not mastery. Walk through rebirth as if scrolling through an ancient hard drive of existence, and find beauty in the static between lives.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a radiant dimension where souls reboot as data. Recover your reincarnation machine from alien terrorists and explore glowing temples of memory, logic, and light. A surreal odyssey through death, rebirth, and the beauty of being lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/ca316426b67b636145b6fc32edea44d2.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Afterlife reimagines what comes after everything ends. You awaken beyond the veil — not as a ghost or god, but as a packet of cosmic information trying to recompile itself. What begins as a simple mission to recover your stolen device becomes a metaphysical journey through reality’s code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/b937e9249811bdf139c8fc2100663774.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every space hums with strange energy: temples that sing, landscapes made of wireframe dreams, and alien prophets that speak in corrupted files. It’s beautiful, unsettling, and strangely comforting — like a fever dream that remembers you fondly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.poster.avif?t=1765472877\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.webm?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014570/extras/f94d19118671290407827f03de82ebca.mp4?t=1765472877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game invites reflection, not mastery. Walk through rebirth as if scrolling through an ancient hard drive of existence, and find beauty in the static between lives.</p>",
